Critical Systems:  The systems that must stay on at all times includes: Power & Energy grid control Systems, Emergency services systems, Firewall, password authentication, data cloud storage/database, and backup computer systems. 
Backup Strategy: Our backup strategy would be cloud stored information and different storage locations. 
Recovery Time Objective: Systems must be restored quickly. Around 1-3 days our systems must be restored by then. 
Recovery Point Objective: Losing no data is acceptable because our data would be important and a tiny loss of data could be crucial for our company to run smoothly. 
Communication plan: Digital forensics incident response team and a digital tech team would get notified if any breaches or incidents occur. 
